  "auto..most.in.stock": "Most in-stock machines ship from our Commerce, CA depot within 2–4 business days, with transit times of 3–10 days depending on your destination. You'll receive tracking once your unit is dispatched.",
  "auto..what.warranty.comes": "What warranty comes with my machine?",
  "auto..every.konstructz.machine": "Every Konstructz machine ships with a structural and powertrain warranty covering the frame, hydraulics, and diesel engine. Coverage length varies by model — full terms are on the Warranty & Returns page.",
  "auto..can.i.return": "Can I return my equipment?",
  "auto..unused.machines.in": "Unused machines in original condition may be eligible for return within the stated window, subject to inspection and a restocking assessment. Review eligibility on the Warranty & Returns page before requesting.",
  "auto..how.do.i": "How do I know which attachment fits?",
  "auto..attachment.fit.depends": "Attachment fit depends on your machine's mounting plate and hydraulic flow. Use our Attachments Support compatibility guide or send us your model and we'll confirm the right match.",
  "auto..do.you.provide": "Do you provide technical support?",
  "auto..yes.our.team": "Yes. Our team offers phone, email, and form-based technical support for setup, operation, and troubleshooting, plus emergency field support for active worksites.",
  "auto..how.can.i": "How can I request replacement parts?",
  "auto..submit.a.parts": "Submit a parts request through Warranty & Returns or Contact Support with your machine model and serial number. We dispatch genuine components directly from our parts warehouse.",
