  "auto.supportkit.learn.more": "Learn more",
  "whychooseus.description": "We build heavy-duty, compact machinery engineered to withstand the toughest worksites. By focusing on mechanical reliability, direct support, and zero-compromise components, we ensure your projects run smoothly without unexpected downtime.",
