  "shipping.freight.offloaded": "Offloaded",
  "shipping.timeline.stock.desc": "Dispatch timing depends on machine status, configuration, inspection, and carrier availability.",
  "shipping.timeline.transit.desc": "Transit time varies by destination, route, carrier schedule, and offload requirements.",
  "shipping.faq.intl.q": "Do you ship internationally?",
  "shipping.faq.intl.a": "Our standard freight network is U.S. based. For Canada, Mexico, and select export destinations we can quote dedicated international logistics — ask your specialist for an international quotation with port-of-entry details.",
  "shipping.faq.res.q": "Is liftgate or residential delivery available?",
  "shipping.faq.res.a": "Most machines are too heavy for liftgate trucks. We use flatbed and step-deck carriers and deliver curbside or to a firm offload pad. Residential delivery is possible if there is suitable truck access and an offload surface.",
