  "chatbot.recommend.askJob": "### What kind of work/job will you be doing?\n\nTell me the job type (e.g. digging trench, grading yards, lifting pallets, compacting driveways) so I can match you to the right Typhon product category.",
  "chatbot.attachments.defaultList": "Hydraulic augers, trenchers, breakers, thumbs, and grading buckets.",
  "chatbot.attachments.intro": "### TYPHON {model} Attachment Compatibility\n\n**Fits auxiliary attachments:** Yes.\n\n*Based on catalog compatibility records:*",
  "chatbot.attachments.flow": "Hydraulic flow",
  "chatbot.attachments.couplers": "Compatible couplers",
  "chatbot.attachments.couplersDesc": "Standard quick coupler fitment.",
  "chatbot.attachments.included": "Included with machine",
  "chatbot.attachments.includedDesc": "check bundle specifications.",
  "chatbot.attachments.warning": "Fitment Warning: Attachment configuration must be confirmed with sales before final shipment.",
  "chatbot.attachments.notFound": "I can check attachment fitment compatibility. Which TYPHON machine model do you own or are looking at? (e.g., STOMP 509 or TERROR XXV)",
  "chatbot.warranty.markdown": "### Standard Typhon Warranty\n\nEvery Typhon machine includes a **1-year warranty + lifetime technical support** standard.\n\nThis covers structural components, main hydraulic pumps, and engines. Wear items are owner-maintained. Contact sales for details.",
  "chatbot.shipping.markdown": "### Continental U.S. Shipping Policy\n\n**Shipping is available in the USA. For overseas or international orders, please contact the sales team so they can confirm availability, cost, and delivery options.**\n\nDomestic flat-rate freight is organized directly to residential or commercial addresses. Liftgate offloading assistance available.",
  "chatbot.shipping.overseas.markdown": "### Overseas & International Inquiries\n\n**Shipping is available in the USA. For overseas or international orders, please contact the sales team so they can confirm availability, cost, and delivery options.**\n\nWe coordinate sea containers and custom broker export invoicing directly. Handoff to sales is required to estimate custom port costs.",
  "chatbot.price.markdown": "### TYPHON {model} Pricing\n\n**Listed price:** **{price}**\n\n*Final price and availability should be confirmed with sales.*",
  "chatbot.price.notFound": "Which machine model are you checking the price for? Tell me the model (e.g. STOMP 509 or TERROR XXV) to view pricing.",
  "chatbot.stock.markdown": "### Catalog Stock Availability\n\n**Stock should be confirmed with sales.** California ready stock fluctuates daily. Please check in with sales to confirm chassis schedules.",
  "chatbot.financing.title": "Financing Options",
  "chatbot.support.markdown": "### Customer Support & Maintenance\n\nEvery machine includes a standard **1-year warranty + lifetime technical support**.\n\nFor technical assistance, ordering replacement components, or general operator guidance, please submit a request to sales/support.",
  "chatbot.spechelper.title": "Spec Glossary",
  "chatbot.spechelper.outro": "Do you want to check this spec on a specific TYPHON model?",
  "chatbot.wrong.forkliftDig": "### Not the Right Machine\n\nAn electric forklift is designed strictly for **lifting and moving pallets** in warehouses, not digging.\n\nFor digging trenches or property work, you should look at a **TYPHON mini excavator** (like TERROR XI or TERROR XXV).\n\n*Common mistake: Do not choose a forklift for digging.*",
  "chatbot.wrong.rollerPallet": "### Not the Right Machine\n\nA road roller is built exclusively for **compacting soil, gravel, and asphalt**, not lifting pallets.\n\nFor material lifting and pallet handling, choose a **TYPHON electric forklift** or a **skid steer loader with pallet forks**.\n\n*Common mistake: A roller has no fork attachments.*",
  "chatbot.wrong.excavatorPallet": "### Not the Right Machine\n\nWhile mini excavators can lift logs with grapples, they are **not designed for forklift-style pallet stacking**.\n\nFor warehouse pallet stacking, choose a **TYPHON electric forklift** (VIGOR series). For outdoor ground pallet handling, choose a **TYPHON skid steer** (STOMP series) with pallet forks.\n\n*Common mistake: Excavator geometry is poor for stacking flat loads.*",
  "chatbot.wrong.loaderDig": "### Not the Right Machine\n\nWheel loaders and skid steers are excellent for **moving, grading, and bulk loading dirt**, but they cannot dig deep trenches.\n\nFor deep utility line excavation, look at a **TYPHON mini excavator**.\n\n*Common mistake: Loaders scrape surface material; they do not dig trenches.*",
  "chatbot.categoryBrowsing": "Which category lineup would you like to browse?\n\n- Mini Excavators\n- Skid Steer Loaders\n- Wheel Loaders\n- Electric Forklifts\n- Road Rollers\n- Attachments",
  "chatbot.unknownQuestion": "I'd be glad to help. Are you looking to find the right machine, check a specification (like horsepower or weight), check attachment fitment, or contact sales for a quote?",
