  "category.desc.mini-excavators": "Compact track hoes from 1 to 4 tons. Perfect for utility trenches, foundations, and tight access landscaping.",
  "category.desc.skid-steer-loaders": "Versatile wheeled and tracked loaders. Run augers, sweepers, trenchers and scrapers with high auxiliary flow.",
  "category.desc.wheel-loaders": "Heavy articulating bucket loaders. High cabin visibility, big bucket capacities and cycle times for moving bulk soil.",
  "category.desc.forklifts": "Warehouse and outdoor electric forklifts. Smooth controls, high free lift mast heights and heavy lift capacities.",
  "category.desc.road-rollers": "Vibratory asphalt and soil rollers. Double drum steering and high compaction forces for subgrade and pavement prep.",
