  "chatbot.greeting.1": "Hi there! I'm your Typhon product expert and sales advisor. I can answer exact specifications, help you choose the right machine for your job, check attachment compatibility, or guide you through financing and shipping details. What can I help you build today?",
  "chatbot.greeting.2": "Hello! I'm your Typhon product expert. Let me know if you need to look up machine specifications, choose a model for a specific job, or check compatible attachments.",
  "chatbot.greeting.3": "Hi! I'm here to help with your Typhon product questions. I can compare models side-by-side, explain shipping and warranty details, or suggest the best machine for your tasks. What project are you working on?",
